{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42200","headline":"赠陶使君求梨 · 徐铉","name":"赠陶使君求梨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨宵宴罢醉如泥，惟忆张公大谷梨。\n白玉花繁曾缀处，黄金色嫩乍成时。\n冷侵肺腑醒偏早，香惹衣襟歇倍迟。\n今旦中山方酒渴，唯应此物最相宜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}